          "level": 1,
          "body": "\nSource : `07-lighting-rendering-editing-final-thoughts.mp4` (21 min 40), transcription Whisper (`reproduction/transcripts/ep07.json`), images `reproduction/frames/ep07/`. « f<N> » = seconde N. Images lues : f330, f440, f700, f880, f1000, f1090 (planche `reproduction/sheets/ep07_a.png`). (2 November 2026)\n\n"
